  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP-DPA Joint Programme (PDA) 2013-2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP-DPA Joint Programme (PDA) 2013-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra f&#xf6;r UNDPs och DPAs gemensamma     program f&#xf6;r konfliktf&#xf6;rebyggande att agera snabbt och effektivt p&#xe5;    landniv&#xe5; i krissituationer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention has the purpose of building national capacities for  conflict prevention. This is done by facilitating rapid and efficient deployment of Peace and Development Advisors to assist UNDP&apos;s country offices in their efforts to implement programmes related to crisis    response.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To preserve and advance human development by supporting the strengthening of national and local capacities to prevent, mitigate and recover from the effects of violent conflicts in priority countries.</narrative>
  </description>
